{"font_size": 0.4, "font_color": "#FFFFFF", "background_alpha": 0.5, "background_color": "#9C27B0", "Stroke": "none", "type": "AIsubtitle", "lang": "zh", "version": "v1.7.0.4", "body": [{"from": 4.04, "to": 4.48, "sid": 1, "location": 2, "content": "Hello", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 4.48, "to": 5.22, "sid": 2, "location": 2, "content": "我是陈耀", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 5.22, "to": 7.26, "sid": 3, "location": 2, "content": "如果前三期的瞄准课程你看过", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 7.26, "to": 8.2, "sid": 4, "location": 2, "content": "请另有小程", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 8.2, "to": 10.2, "sid": 5, "location": 2, "content": "你的一次定位能力一定很不错了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 10.2, "to": 11.28, "sid": 6, "location": 2, "content": "当你碰到类似这种", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 11.28, "to": 13.14, "sid": 7, "location": 2, "content": "敌方基本处于静止状态的情况", "music": 0.09677418834547352}, {"from": 13.14, "to": 15.43, "sid": 8, "location": 2, "content": "你也能做到像龟一样克秒对面", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 15.43, "to": 16.55, "sid": 9, "location": 2, "content": "但是问题来了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 16.55, "to": 17.99, "sid": 10, "location": 2, "content": "当你碰到动态目标时", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 17.99, "to": 18.91, "sid": 11, "location": 2, "content": "你可能会像这样", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 18.91, "to": 21.95, "sid": 12, "location": 2, "content": "马枪子弹落点总是在对方移动前的位置", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 21.95, "to": 23.49, "sid": 13, "location": 2, "content": "弹幕觉得是什么问题呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 23.49, "to": 24.43, "sid": 14, "location": 2, "content": "可以暂停一下", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 24.43, "to": 25.17, "sid": 15, "location": 2, "content": "想想看", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 25.17, "to": 26.85, "sid": 16, "location": 2, "content": "是视觉失焦的问题吗", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 26.85, "to": 28.96, "sid": 17, "location": 2, "content": "我个人认为这是其中一个原因", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 28.96, "to": 30.58, "sid": 18, "location": 2, "content": "如果无法聚焦移动中的目标", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 30.58, "to": 32.04, "sid": 19, "location": 2, "content": "就无法捕捉到静止窗口", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 32.04, "to": 33.46, "sid": 20, "location": 2, "content": "只能靠感觉去定位", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 33.46, "to": 35.349, "sid": 21, "location": 2, "content": "精准度会大打折扣", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 35.349, "to": 37.129, "sid": 22, "location": 2, "content": "还有另一个重要的原因", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 37.129, "to": 38.689, "sid": 23, "location": 2, "content": "就是你开枪时的发力", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 38.689, "to": 40.109, "sid": 24, "location": 2, "content": "整个瞄准过程的发力", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 40.109, "to": 42.029, "sid": 25, "location": 2, "content": "在第一期视频中也详细的讲了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 42.029, "to": 42.869, "sid": 26, "location": 2, "content": "发力越小", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 42.869, "to": 44.46, "sid": 27, "location": 2, "content": "定位速度越慢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 44.7, "to": 47.48, "sid": 28, "location": 2, "content": "眼睛捕捉到静止窗口是一瞬间的事儿", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 47.48, "to": 49.06, "sid": 29, "location": 2, "content": "但是手去完成定位", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 49.06, "to": 51.06, "sid": 30, "location": 2, "content": "这个过程是有一定滞后性的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 51.06, "to": 52.36, "sid": 31, "location": 2, "content": "如果你发力过小", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 52.36, "to": 53.34, "sid": 32, "location": 2, "content": "定位速度过慢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 53.34, "to": 54.42, "sid": 33, "location": 2, "content": "在这段时间中", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 54.42, "to": 56.02, "sid": 34, "location": 2, "content": "目标又移动了一段距离", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 56.02, "to": 57.86, "sid": 35, "location": 2, "content": "所以会导致你空枪", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 57.86, "to": 59.4, "sid": 36, "location": 2, "content": "但到这还没结束", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 59.4, "to": 60.56, "sid": 37, "location": 2, "content": "由于每次对枪时", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 60.56, "to": 62.05, "sid": 38, "location": 2, "content": "自己的反应速度不同", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 62.05, "to": 65.53, "sid": 39, "location": 2, "content": "目标是靠近准星还是远离准星等等因素", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 65.53, "to": 68.53, "sid": 40, "location": 2, "content": "一旦准星超出了自己静止窗口射击的舒适区", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 68.53, "to": 70.17, "sid": 41, "location": 2, "content": "马枪的概率也会大大增加", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 71.77, "to": 74.45, "sid": 42, "location": 2, "content": "所以还要加上同向跟枪这一步骤", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 74.45, "to": 77.98, "sid": 43, "location": 2, "content": "这样一来准星就不会脱离自己的视觉焦点了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 77.98, "to": 80.02, "sid": 44, "location": 2, "content": "通过这种可以转化实战的练习", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 80.02, "to": 81.94, "sid": 45, "location": 2, "content": "才能实打实的提升游戏水平", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 81.94, "to": 83.96, "sid": 46, "location": 2, "content": "接下来说第二种动态定位方式", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 83.96, "to": 86.22, "sid": 47, "location": 2, "content": "在此之前先提醒一下大家", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 86.22, "to": 89.57, "sid": 48, "location": 2, "content": "up每期视频的重点是不仅要听完前面的理论", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 89.57, "to": 92.31, "sid": 49, "location": 2, "content": "后面练习合集中也有非常重要的细节", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 92.31, "to": 93.01, "sid": 50, "location": 2, "content": "也要听完", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 93.01, "to": 93.73, "sid": 51, "location": 2, "content": "且做好", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 93.73, "to": 95.91, "sid": 52, "location": 2, "content": "听完加练对才有效果", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 95.91, "to": 98.56, "sid": 53, "location": 2, "content": "并且一定要按照每期的顺序进行练习", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 98.56, "to": 100.1, "sid": 54, "location": 2, "content": "没学过前三期的同学啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 100.1, "to": 101.56, "sid": 55, "location": 2, "content": "建议先补课加练习", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 101.56, "to": 103.25, "sid": 56, "location": 2, "content": "不然训练效果会很差", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 103.25, "to": 104.71, "sid": 57, "location": 2, "content": "同时真心求个关注", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 104.71, "to": 105.77, "sid": 58, "location": 2, "content": "因为只收藏的话", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 105.77, "to": 107.81, "sid": 59, "location": 2, "content": "后续的课程就刷不到了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 107.81, "to": 109.01, "sid": 60, "location": 2, "content": "言归正传啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 109.01, "to": 112.05, "sid": 61, "location": 2, "content": "当目标的运动轨迹是趋向于自己准星的时候", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 112.05, "to": 113.81, "sid": 62, "location": 2, "content": "枪比同向跟枪架定位", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 113.81, "to": 116.72, "sid": 63, "location": 2, "content": "其实更效率的是使用撞枪这一技巧", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 116.72, "to": 119.33, "sid": 64, "location": 2, "content": "感觉是用自己的准星去接触目标一样", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 119.33, "to": 121.15, "sid": 65, "location": 2, "content": "与金属窗口主动定位不同", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 121.15, "to": 122.95, "sid": 66, "location": 2, "content": "撞枪更偏向于被动瞄准", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 122.95, "to": 124.63, "sid": 67, "location": 2, "content": "是敌人主动撞上准星", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 124.63, "to": 126.61, "sid": 68, "location": 2, "content": "这个后面有专项的训练", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 126.61, "to": 127.91, "sid": 69, "location": 2, "content": "最后拓展一下", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 127.91, "to": 129.97, "sid": 70, "location": 2, "content": "通过练习这两种动态定位方式", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 129.97, "to": 132.89, "sid": 71, "location": 2, "content": "命中动态目标的能力能得到显著的提升", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 132.89, "to": 135.01, "sid": 72, "location": 2, "content": "但真正的高手在瞄准过程中啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 135.01, "to": 136.77, "sid": 73, "location": 2, "content": "可以瞬间根据情况的不同", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 136.77, "to": 138.86, "sid": 74, "location": 2, "content": "选择最合适的方式进行定位的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 138.86, "to": 140.98, "sid": 75, "location": 2, "content": "这也是需要大量游戏经验支撑的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 140.98, "to": 144.029, "sid": 76, "location": 2, "content": "希望大家在后面转化实战时能越来越熟练", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 144.029, "to": 145.989, "sid": 77, "location": 2, "content": "接下来就是最重要的训练合集啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 145.989, "to": 147.069, "sid": 78, "location": 2, "content": "一定要做好细节", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 147.069, "to": 150.02, "sid": 79, "location": 2, "content": "不要无效练枪哦", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 153.88, "to": 156.74, "sid": 80, "location": 2, "content": "这个项目啊是第一期粉丝群内的加练项目", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 156.74, "to": 159.1, "sid": 81, "location": 2, "content": "视觉焦点一定只看目标跟枪", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 159.1, "to": 162.78, "sid": 82, "location": 2, "content": "整个过程是手部操控鼠标自然无意识进行的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 162.78, "to": 166.66, "sid": 83, "location": 2, "content": "一定不能刻意去控制准星跟中目标跟枪时", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 166.66, "to": 169.1, "sid": 84, "location": 2, "content": "手部要保持第一期中讲到的张力", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 169.1, "to": 170.82, "sid": 85, "location": 2, "content": "握手状态不能完全放松", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 170.82, "to": 172.06, "sid": 86, "location": 2, "content": "也不能过度紧绷", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 172.06, "to": 173.36, "sid": 87, "location": 2, "content": "让视角看上去啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 173.36, "to": 175.02, "sid": 88, "location": 2, "content": "尽可能平滑", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 175.669, "to": 176.749, "sid": 89, "location": 2, "content": "聚焦目标后啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 176.749, "to": 178.369, "sid": 90, "location": 2, "content": "瞬间判断目标的移动轨迹", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 178.369, "to": 180.22, "sid": 91, "location": 2, "content": "这点非常重要哈", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 180.22, "to": 183.44, "sid": 92, "location": 2, "content": "手眼同步后跟踪目标一定只看目标", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 183.44, "to": 186.22, "sid": 93, "location": 2, "content": "手部操控鼠标是自然无意识的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 186.22, "to": 189.45, "sid": 94, "location": 2, "content": "一定不能刻意控制准星去跟踪目标", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 189.73, "to": 193.13, "sid": 95, "location": 2, "content": "训练时让准星跟着小球内部捕捉到静止窗口", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 193.13, "to": 194.01, "sid": 96, "location": 2, "content": "开枪定位", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 194.01, "to": 196.45, "sid": 97, "location": 2, "content": "此时的静止窗口是这样的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 196.85, "to": 198.45, "sid": 98, "location": 2, "content": "一定要优先准确度", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 198.45, "to": 199.11, "sid": 99, "location": 2, "content": "练习中", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 199.11, "to": 201.15, "sid": 100, "location": 2, "content": "如果发现一个小球得打很多次", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 201.15, "to": 202.91, "sid": 101, "location": 2, "content": "请先降低开火频率", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 202.91, "to": 206.075, "sid": 102, "location": 2, "content": "让跟枪这一步骤久一些再进行开枪", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 208.48, "to": 210.6, "sid": 103, "location": 2, "content": "失业焦点的细节跟上面训练一致", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 210.6, "to": 213.72, "sid": 104, "location": 2, "content": "区别是训练时让准星跟着小球外部", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 213.72, "to": 215.3, "sid": 105, "location": 2, "content": "跟随小球同向移动", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 215.3, "to": 216.44, "sid": 106, "location": 2, "content": "捕捉到静止窗口", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 216.44, "to": 217.18, "sid": 107, "location": 2, "content": "开枪定位", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 217.18, "to": 219.5, "sid": 108, "location": 2, "content": "此时的静止窗口是这样的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 221.46, "to": 222.54, "sid": 109, "location": 2, "content": "聚焦目标后啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 222.54, "to": 224.28, "sid": 110, "location": 2, "content": "瞬间判断目标移动轨迹", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 224.28, "to": 227.02, "sid": 111, "location": 2, "content": "手眼同步控制准星移动到视觉焦点内", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 227.02, "to": 228.5, "sid": 112, "location": 2, "content": "准备去接住目标", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 228.5, "to": 230.36, "sid": 113, "location": 2, "content": "一定只看目标", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 230.57, "to": 231.83, "sid": 114, "location": 2, "content": "准星完全静止", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 231.83, "to": 233.09, "sid": 115, "location": 2, "content": "等目标撞上准星", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 233.09, "to": 235.3, "sid": 116, "location": 2, "content": "开枪或者右手稍作定位", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 235.3, "to": 237.54, "sid": 117, "location": 2, "content": "去接即将撞上准星的目标", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 237.54, "to": 239.6, "sid": 118, "location": 2, "content": "前者适合准星目标相对距离短", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 239.6, "to": 241.329, "sid": 119, "location": 2, "content": "后者适合相对距离较长", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 241.329, "to": 242.749, "sid": 120, "location": 2, "content": "要根据情况选择", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 242.749, "to": 246.37, "sid": 121, "location": 2, "content": "但一定不能只使用一种方式去定位细节", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 246.37, "to": 247.35, "sid": 122, "location": 2, "content": "跟上面训练一致", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 247.35, "to": 251.03, "sid": 123, "location": 2, "content": "区别是综合使用撞枪和同向跟枪加开火", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 251.03, "to": 253.21, "sid": 124, "location": 2, "content": "两种方式进行射击", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 254.94, "to": 257.0, "sid": 125, "location": 2, "content": "以上就是主播瞄准篇的第四期", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 257.0, "to": 260.22, "sid": 126, "location": 2, "content": "至此主播瞄准篇基本功的部分就结束了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 260.22, "to": 262.42, "sid": 127, "location": 2, "content": "后面的课程就是实战进阶部分了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 262.42, "to": 263.54, "sid": 128, "location": 2, "content": "要想熟练运用", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 263.54, "to": 265.669, "sid": 129, "location": 2, "content": "请一定练习好这几期的基本功", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 265.669, "to": 267.009, "sid": 130, "location": 2, "content": "基本功越扎实", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 267.009, "to": 269.829, "sid": 131, "location": 2, "content": "在负反馈本来就比较多的瞄准提升过程中啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 269.829, "to": 272.47, "sid": 132, "location": 2, "content": "就能收获到一些进步提升的喜悦", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 272.47, "to": 274.81, "sid": 133, "location": 2, "content": "点个关注就不会错过完整的课程啦", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 274.81, "to": 276.36, "sid": 134, "location": 2, "content": "我们下期见", "music": 0.0}], "bvid": "BV1eehiz9EEc", "title": "目标一动就马枪？一个视频让你真正学会动态定位！【瓦瞄准修炼秘籍4】", "owner": "晨曜cheyo", "duration": 278}